ndet uns auch bei </strong><strong><a href=\"https://twitter.com/retrokompott\">Twitter</a>, </strong><strong>auf </strong><strong><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/retrokompott/?fref=ts\">Facebook</a>, </strong></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><strong>oder auf unser </strong><strong><a href=\"http://www.retrokompott.de\">Homepage</a></strong><strong>.</strong></span></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">Unterstuetzen kann man den Podcast bei <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/retrokompott?ty=h\">PATREON</a><br />\n</span></span></p>\n<hr />\n<p><span class=\"author-p-75959\"><br />\n</span></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\">Die Links aus dem Podcast:</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid652\" class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"> </span></div>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\"> <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/retrokompott\">Patreon </a><br />\n</span></p>\n<div id=\"magicdomid661\" class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">Empfehlungen:</span></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid662\" class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid663\" class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">1:  Retrogamer &#8211; Ein vierteljaehrliches Magazin ueber alte Spiele und Hardware,  erhaeltlich bei </span><span class=\"author-p-75959 url\"><a href=\"https://shop.heise.de/\">https://shop.heise.de/</a></span></div>\n<div class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"></div>\n<div id=\"magicdomid664\" class=\"ace-line\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span class=\"author-p-75959\">2: Spielkonsolen